Error [E2423]: Function `almost` promises `Never` but can reach the end.
  --> tests/ui/never_return_fallthrough.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     if flag { panic("stop") }
    |     ^^
 Why: A declared `Never` return means every path must stop; this path falls through instead (D-NEVER2=B).
 Fix: End every path with `panic`, a `Never` call, or another diverging operation, or remove `Never`.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2423
